to fish in the lake."},{"icon":"🦑","type":"sea-monsters","x":482.4,"y":271.1,"cell":1258,"i":25,"name":"Marsh Monster","note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 17 m long."},{"icon":"🦑","type":"sea-monsters","x":333.61,"y":686.03,"cell":7199,"i":26,"name":"Clitham Monster","note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 18 m long."},{"icon":"👹","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":936.38,"y":427.47,"cell":3815,"i":27,"name":"Camble Giant","note":"Tales speak of a big Giant who inhabits Camble hills and abducts young women."},{"icon":"🗻","type":"sacred-mountains","dy":48,"x":662.4,"y":335.19,"cell":2327,"i":28,"name":"Tunul Mountain","note":"A sacred mountain of No religion. Height: 3025m."},{"icon":"🌳","type":"sacred-forests","x":957.1,"y":187.1,"cell":757,"i":29,"name":"Wistore Forest","note":"A forest sacred to local Nortumbic Shamanism."},{"icon":"🌲","type":"sacred-pineries","px":13,"x":918.31,"y":115.11,"cell":266,"i":30,"name":"Grorrez Pinery","note":"A pinery sacred to local Aj'Snaga Beliefs."},{"icon":"🌴","type":"sacred-palm-groves","px":13,"x":1060.7,"y":672,"cell":7141,"i":31,"name":"Bieiertallen Palm Grove","note":"A palm grove sacred to local Schwarzen Shamanism."},{"icon":"🏴‍☠️","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1119.2,"y":254.46,"cell":1224,"i":32,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"🏴‍☠️","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1154.78,"y":394.99,"cell":3248,"i":33,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"🏴‍☠️","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":933.34,"y":228.94,"cell":928,"i":34,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"🏴‍☠️","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":469.17,"y":251.77,"cell":1147,"i":35,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"🗿","type":"statues","x":823.54,"y":659.77,"cell":6996,"i":36,"name":"Gneabok Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">᠐ᠮᠿᡗᢏᠲᡳᡴᠵ᠑ᢓᠲᡭᠲᡠᢡᠳᠪᠵᠰᠻᡱᡖᡴᡓᠼᠳᠪᢥᡴᢠ᠀ᢋᡲᢤᢡᢠ᠑ᠮᢓᡔᢒᢑᡕᠰᡴᠩᢓ᠀ᡡᠻᡔᠠᡑᡟᠩᠼᡗᠲᠱᢒᢑᢏᢐᢐ</div>"},{"icon":"🗿","type":"statues","x":953.74,"y":162.27,"cell":596,"i":37,"name":"Dunstowces Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༺༧༘༕༩༌༭༥༙༣༖༸༕༕༊༩༰༵༄༤༬༯༔༲༘༓༢༘༮༑༷༿༭༘༐༱༌༡༩༚༉༸༻༆༕༡༒༤༤</div>"},{"icon":"🏺","type":"ruins","x":380.26,"y":340.24,"cell":2293,"i":38,"name":"Ruined Temple","note":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"🏺","type":"ruins","x":454.7,"y":588.7,"cell":5801,"i":39,"name":"Ruined Temple","note":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"🏺","type":"ruins","x":599.64,"y":777.03,"cell":8659,"i":40,"name":"Ruined Mausoleum","note":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"📚","type":"libraries","x":551.57,"y":320.94,"cell":2165,"i":41,"name":"Barham Library","note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"🎪","type":"circuses","x":1007.87,"y":405.39,"cell":3544,"i":42,"name":"Travelling Fantastical Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this fantastical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"🎪","type":"circuses","x":570.01,"y":132.79,"cell":295,"i":43,"name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"🤺","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":965.23,"y":717.22,"cell":7690,"i":44,"name":"Churgath Melee","note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a melee of brutality in Churgath, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"🎠","type":"fairs","x":664.01,"y":392.18,"cell":3340,"i":45,"name":"Kiburaz Fair","note":"A fair is being held in Kiburaz, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"icon":"🛶","type":"canoes","x":915.21,"y":211.15,"cell":808,"i":46,"name":"Minor Jetty","note":"A small location along the Lympsleton Creek to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"🐗","type":"migration","x":743.3,"y":122.3,"cell":254,"i":47,"name":"Lions migration","note":"A huge group of lions are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"🦇","type":"caves","x":1153.2,"y":566.26,"cell":5607,"i":48,"name":"Tsenkhon Cave","note":"The Tsenkhon Cave. Locals claim that it is completely flooded."},{"icon":"🌀","type":"portals","px":14,"x":272.56,"y":391.2,"cell":3129,"i":49,"name":"Ropedrande Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"🌀","type":"portals","px":14,"x":223.51,"y":757.62,"cell":8336,"i":50,"name":"Axbridmin Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"🌀","type":"portals","px":14,"x":475.98,"y":539.52,"cell":4972,"i":51,"name":"Paigntates Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"🌀","type":"portals","px":14,"x":728.7,"y":253.2,"cell":1290,"i":52,"name":"Penkhampton Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"🌀","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1081.42,"y":821.51,"cell":9271,"i":53,"name":"Kilkun Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"🌀","type":"portals","px":14,"x":852,"y":289.99,"cell":1677,"i":54,"name":"Watchton Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"🌀","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1177.85,"y":709.13,"cell":7715,"i":55,"name":"Nurkeyaba Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"🌀","type":"portals","px":14,"x":549.83,"y":566.16,"cell":5511,"i":56,"name":"Chinseytes Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"🎆","type":"rifts","x":1100.2,"y":280.9,"cell":1599,"i":57,"name":"Ancient Rift","note":"A rumoured ancient rift in this area is causing an emmissary to step through with an all-powerful relic."},{"icon":"💀","type":"disturbed-burials","x":1039.71,"y":289.29,"cell":1705,"i":58,"name":"Disturbed Burial","note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"🪦","type":"necropolises","x":716.22,"y":189.58,"cell":728,"i":59,"name":"Santiet Necropolis","note":"An eerie necropolis where nature intertwines with death. Overgrown tombstones are entwined by thorny vines, and mournful spirits wander among the fading petals of once-vibrant flowers."},{"icon":"🧙","type":"encounters","x":287.84,"y":735.25,"cell":7904,"i":60,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4790\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"🧙","type":"encounters","x":718.98,"y":707.68,"cell":7517,"i":61,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4491\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"🧙","type":"encounters","x":1055.4,"y":467.8,"cell":4323,"i":62,"name":"Rand